Vendored first-party code
-------------------------
services/h3kit/canvas.py and services/h3kit/timing.py are byte-for-byte copies
of the same-named modules in johna101/gallery's `packages/h3kit` (MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Biagio Maffettone) — the same author as this project.

They are copies rather than adaptations on purpose: MiniMax H3 Canvas has to
agree exactly with that compiler about what a legal canvas and frame count are,
and keeping the files identical makes "has this drifted?" a byte comparison.
Gallery's own test suite carries that comparison. Edit them there, not here.

